  "description": "The language layer and data types of the OutWit Smt controller: a strict SMT-LIB 2.6 reader with shape limits, shared by everything that reads a problem before a solver does, and the wire types of the packages a node solves and returns. The options of a run, the preflight and the diagnostics are published as job documents (smt.options@1, smt.preflight@1, smt.diagnostics@1) for applications that are not .NET, with the schema and the Python and C++ bindings under documents/.",
